BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Toronto Bike Meetup
UID:event_315919363@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260804T033936Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260830T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260830T150000
SUMMARY:A ride north - Bridlewood Mall to Ballantrae
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Bike Meetup\nSTART TIME IS NOW 0900 (9am) to let it wa
 rm up a bit!\nA fun\, friendly\, chill\, steady-paced\, NO DROP ride.\n\n1
 . Ride duration\n\n* Ride duration is expected to be around 4-4.5 hours\n*
  \\~2 hours there and \\~2 hours back\, plus a break at the midpoint\n* Ab
 out 72km there and back\n\n2. Locations\n\n* Starting: Tim hortons at brid
 lewood mall (2900 Warden Ave. Unit 149\, Scarborough\, ON M1W 2S8)\n* Mid-
 point: Coach House Pub\, 3 Felcher Blvd\, Whitchurch-Stouffville\, ON L4A 
 3H4\n* Ending: Same as start\n\n3. Route conditions:\n\n* Path type: Paved
 / Dedicated/Road\n* Majority of the ride will be on the road\, so please m
 ake sure you are comfortable riding in a group on the road\, side by side.
 \n* Distance (total): Approximately 72KM\;\n\n4. Ride requirements:\n\n* A
 verage speed by the end of the ride will be around 23-24kmph\, on flats we
  will be doing closer to 30kmph. (Please make sure you are comfortable wit
 h these speeds)\n* We will have some elevation especially on the way there
 . On the way back should be faster.\n* We WILL stop at red lights to regro
 up\n* Break(s): Lunch break in Ballantrae at a pub\n* Bike type: Any\, but
  a hybrid or road bike is better suited for the target speed\;\n* Helmets 
 are absolutely required. NO exceptions. I will not lead a ride with partic
 ipants who aren't suitably protected\n* While this is a daytime ride\, mar
 ker lights are always a good idea\n\n5. Additional notes:\n\n* This will b
 e a NO DROP ride\, but be honest about your ability to maintain the antici
 pated speed\n* Please bring sufficient water and food for the ride\n* This
  ride is weather permitting. If conditions are uncertain the deciding time
  is 7 PM the night before the event\;\n* Please be on time and respect you
 r RSVP\; We will leave on time\;\n* Feel free to bring a guest provided th
 ey can follow all the instructions on this post\;\n* This ride aims to be 
 gender-balanced and inclusive\;\n* By taking part in this event you attest
 : a) you are in good health\, b) you participate at your own risks\, and c
 ) you release the organizer(s) from any responsibility and/or liability wh
 atsoever\;\n\nLooking forward to riding with you!\n\n[Bridlewood Mall to C
 oach House Pub - Google Maps](https://www.google.com/maps/dir/Bridlewood+M
 all\,+2900+Warden+Ave.\,+Scarborough\,+ON+M1W+2S8/Coach+House+Pub\,+3+Felc
 her+Blvd\,+Whitchurch-Stouffville\,+ON+L4A+3H4/@43.8946778\,-79.4517101\,1
 1z/data=!4m14!4m13!1m5!1m1!1s0x89d4d3bbdfe2909f:0xe4d9a1e24c5c04b6!2m2!1d-
 79.3180556!2d43.7986111!1m5!1m1!1s0x89d52de41feba805:0x7762d01db15836b9!2m
 2!1d-79.2971835!2d44.0335401!3e1?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDcyOC4wIKXMDSoASA
 FQAw%3D%3D)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/torontobikemeetup/events/315919363/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260731T135231Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260731T135231Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
